# Audit 2026-05-20 (F9): the working tree repeatedly diverged to CRLF while HEAD
# stayed LF, creating 200+ phantom "modified" files. This forces LF in the repo.
#
# After committing this file, run ONCE on Windows to normalize existing history:
#   git add --renormalize .
#   git commit -m "chore: normalize line endings to LF"

* text=auto eol=lf

# Cadence sources
*.cdc text eol=lf

# Binary assets - never normalize
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
*.mp4 binary
